From: SWEET RMX1971 port (ZCode agent + AppleCampus)
Subject: [PATCH 0082] sweet: Himax HX83112A SPI touch for the Realme Q (sdm712)

GENI SPI SE0 @0x880000 master, 64 KiB noflash firmware download (0F flow),
56-byte event frames polled on the INT gpio, coordinates into SweetHID.
Boot args: sweethimax=1, sweetmaxdelay=N. Default off.

